* **Speaker Mode (`2.0 Vrms` DACs — HiBy FC3 / TRN Black Pearl):** Set `flac_ax --volume 0.80` (and DAC hardware buttons near max) so the DAC outputs a clean `~1.6–2.0 Vrms` signal, then control room volume solely on the amplifier's physical dial. *(If using the `2.5 Vrms` **FiiO KA11**, cap `--volume` at **`0.70–0.75`** to avoid overdriving budget TPA3116 inputs.)*
